        <activityName xml:lang="en">External drive, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: External drive, at plant
The dataset is a mix of storage drives available in the market; UUID: c3b235ed-2a16-3419-9c61-dea339d5b88c
The dataset is modeled as a mix of SSD and HDD, with a ratio of 60:40 according to the market projection (Statista, 2017). In total, the external drives have the capacity of approximately 500 GB - 1000 GB. For SSD and HDD, each storage drives is modeled individually as its own module.
Location: Data for global average external drives.
Technology: SSD and HDD storage drives are considered.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c3b235ed-2a16-3419-9c61-dea339d5b88c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
